  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups cauliflower",
    "1 clove garlic",
    "Juice of 1 lemon",
    "1 tablespoon tahini",
    "1 teaspoon cumin",
    "½ teaspoon salt",
    "5 tablespoons extra virgin olive oil",
    "To serve: black pepper (chopped fresh parsley, olive oil.)",
    "1 cup milled flax seeds",
    "2 large eggs",
    "2 teaspoon harissa paste",
    "2 tablespoons almond meal",
    "½ teaspoon salt",
    "To serve: a selection of vegetable crudités and olives."
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Chop the cauliflower into florets and steam for 4 minutes, allow to cool.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cauliflower-hummus-with-harissa-crackers/#wprm-recipe-52698-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/cauliflower-hummus-w-harissa-crackers-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Begin to prepare your crackers by combining all the ingredients together until a dough forms.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cauliflower-hummus-with-harissa-crackers/#wprm-recipe-52698-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/cauliflower-hummus-w-harissa-crackers-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll out the dough between 2 sheets of baking parchment until it reaches the desired thickness – the thinner the cracker the crisper it will be.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cauliflower-hummus-with-harissa-crackers/#wprm-recipe-52698-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/cauliflower-hummus-w-harissa-crackers-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Score the dough with a knife to create a grid, this will make it easier to break apart once cooked. Bake for 10 minutes at 350°F then flip the crackers and bake for 5 minutes more.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cauliflower-hummus-with-harissa-crackers/#wprm-recipe-52698-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/cauliflower-hummus-w-harissa-crackers-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile prepare the hummus by using a food processor to blend the cooked cauliflower, garlic, lemon juice, tahini, cumin, salt, and olive oil. Keep processing until almost smooth.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cauliflower-hummus-with-harissa-crackers/#wprm-recipe-52698-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/cauliflower-hummus-w-harissa-crackers-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve - top the hummus with a swirl of olive oil, chopped fresh parsley and cracked black pepper. Present on a platter with the crackers and optional vegetable crudités.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cauliflower-hummus-with-harissa-crackers/#wprm-recipe-52698-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
